Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:09:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Check again before Play opens a desk from the Registry

With the Case Ledger open when the Lightkeeper retired a campaign, the
row kept its Play, which opened a desk for the retired campaign (issue
#42). enterAsPlayer now reads the user's lists first; an investigator
no longer active in that campaign stays on the hub with "<name> is no
longer in <campaign>." and the book shows the fresh lists. FAQ.md and
QUIRKS.md say so.

Checked in Chromium at 390x844, 820x1180 and 1366x768: book open,
campaign retired over the API, Play pressed; the tab stays on the hub
with the notice, opens no socket, and the row moves to Not in a
campaign. Frontend builds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WaLz6UBTQ5XaTKSYwqeMKA
